---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Andrew Dobrow" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <article class="prose">
        <h1>About</h1>

        <p>
          I've been writing on the internet for most of my adult life. For a long time that meant WordPress,
          hosted platforms, and someone else's editor. This site is a deliberate step back from all of that.
          Built from scratch, intentionally minimalist, deployed from a terminal, designed by hand.
        </p>

        <p>
          I can't promise consistency. I've broken that promise too many times to make it again. What I can
          promise is that when I write here, it's because I actually have something to say.
        </p>

        <p>
          By day I work as a mobile and online notary public, and as a Digital Court Reporter. Outside of that I build things: web products, mobile apps, local services,
          content businesses. Most of it lives under <a href="https://lowsignal.dev" target="_blank">Low Signal Labs</a>,
          a small web studio I run.
        </p>

        <h2>Projects</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://plainnews.app" target="_blank">Plain</a> — hourly AI-curated national news</li>
          <li><a href="https://treasurecoast.today" target="_blank">Treasure Coast Today</a> — hyperlocal Florida news</li>
          <li><a href="https://comingattractions.app" target="_blank">Coming Attractions</a> — random movie and TV picker</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Elsewhere</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://x.com/andrewdobrow" target="_blank">X / Twitter</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://lowsignal.dev" target="_blank">Low Signal Labs</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/andrewdobrow" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 26px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .prose {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .prose p { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }

  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .prose li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

  .prose a {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .prose a:hover { opacity: 0.6; }
</style>